      "categoryID": 4,
      "benefits": "Demonstrated clinical effect in a specific population: increased growth velocity in prepubertal children with growth hormone deficiency during an open-label year-long sermorelin/GHRH-(1-29) study. This pediatric growth outcome is distinct from adult wellness claims. It does not establish improved strength, recovery, sleep, fat loss, or longevity in healthy adults, and it should not be presented as proof that the library's adult community regimens provide those benefits."
    }
